        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mackenzie Davis, Michael Dowse, Elan Mastai, TJ Dawe, Michael Rinaldi\n- Films: Smashed, Breathe In, That Awkward Moment, The F Word, Izzy Gets the F*ck Across Town\n- Awards: Canadian Screen Awards\n- Places: Los Angeles\n\nFacts:\n- Mackenzie Davis made her film debut in \"Smashed\".\n- Mackenzie Davis later appeared in \"Breathe In\" and \"That Awkward Moment\".\n- \"The F Word\" is a 2013 Canadian romantic comedy film directed by Michael Dowse and written by Elan Mastai.\n- \"The F Word\" is based on the play \"Toothpaste and Cigars\" by TJ Dawe and Michael Rinaldi.\n- Mackenzie Davis appeared in \"The F Word\" and received a Canadian Screen Award nomination for that film.\n- \"Izzy Gets the F*ck Across Town\" stars Mackenzie Davis as a woman at rock bottom who must cross Los Angeles to crash her ex-boyfriend's engagement party.",
